Static website hosting :using s3 ,route 53 ,go daddy domain 


what is Static website hosting ?

In AWS we can host a static website using amazon s3 (simple storage service)


how it works?

Create an s3 bucket 
to uncheck block all public access and check acknowledgement
upload html css js and image files to bucket
select properties and enable static website hosting
select permissions attach bucket json policy

access the website using the s3 website endpoint 

or

map our own domain using services such as amazon route 53


select route53 in that create hosted zones 
copy route values paste it in godaddy domain name servers
select hosted zone and create records

copy paste domain name in browser http://domainname


